
# Walkthrough: Phase 21 - Critical Maintenance Sprint

> **Objective:** Fix critical bugs identified by Windsurf Audit (2026-01-10).
> **Status:** ✅ COMPLETE
> **Date:** 2026-01-10

## 🐛 Bug Fixes

### 1. Pending Tasks Visibility (Critical)
- **Issue:** [brain_list_tasks(status="PENDING")](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2372-2391) returned empty list because it only read the legacy [tasks.json](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/ledger/tasks.json) (which was empty) and ignored [task.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/task.md).
- **Root Cause:** 
    1. Data Ingestion: [brain_scan_commitments](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#3209-3225) was scanning [artifacts/](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#199-217) subfolder instead of root, and [rg](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2300-2317) command was malformed.
    2. Data Retrieval: [brain_list_tasks](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2372-2391) did not query the `commitment_ledger`.
- **Fix:**
    - Updated [scan_for_commitments](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/commitment_ledger.py#671-736) to scan [brain_path](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#47-56) (root) and strictly parse [rg](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2300-2317) output (ignoring [.resolved](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/task.md.resolved) files).
    - Updated [_list_tasks](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#323-395) to load `commitment_ledger` and merge items into the response.
- **Verification:**
    - [brain_scan_commitments](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#3209-3225) found **455** items.
    - [brain_list_tasks(PENDING)](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2372-2391) returned **455** tasks.

### 2. Proof Generation Args
- **Issue:** Windsurf reported "Argument count mismatch" for [brain_generate_proof](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2167-2194).
- **Analysis:** Code inspection confirmed `ProofSystem._generate_proof` accepts `args: Dict`, and the wrapper passes a dictionary.
- **Result:** Verified as False Positive/Caller Error.

### 3. Trigger Evaluation
- **Issue:** Windsurf reported [brain_evaluate_triggers](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#2333-2337) returns `None`.
- **Analysis:** Code ensures `List[str]` return in all paths (success or exception).
- **Result:** Verified as False Positive.

